      "notes": "Launched at GIIAS July 2026. Four-door city car based on the Hongguang Mini EV platform. AC time is SOC 20–100%; DC time is 30–80% (DC power and connector not published). Boot 170 L with seats up, 838 L folded. Conflicts: oto.com lists power '67' and torque 91 Nm and 5 seats, and gives the SR battery as 16 kWh; Moladin's preview gives width 1,520 mm; the official wuling.id figures (30 kW, 85 Nm, 4 seats, 1,550 mm) are used. Lifetime core-component warranty was quoted as part of the GIIAS 2026 launch package. Long Range adds ESC, EPB with auto hold, hill hold, rear camera, smart entry and 10.1-inch screen. Ground clearance 184 mm from oto.com only. Motor type, kerb weight and heat pump (none) from the Chinese spec of the 2026 four-door Hongguang Mini EV 301 km (25.1 kWh, 30 kW, 85 Nm; data.carnewschina.com).",
      "notes_id": "Diluncurkan di GIIAS Juli 2026. City car empat pintu berbasis platform Hongguang Mini EV. Waktu AC untuk SOC 20–100%; waktu DC untuk 30–80% (daya DC dan jenis konektor tidak dipublikasikan). Bagasi 170 L dengan jok tegak, 838 L saat dilipat. Data berbeda: oto.com mencantumkan tenaga '67', torsi 91 Nm, dan 5 kursi, serta baterai SR 16 kWh; pratinjau Moladin menyebut lebar 1.520 mm; dipakai angka resmi wuling.id (30 kW, 85 Nm, 4 kursi, 1.550 mm). Garansi komponen inti seumur hidup disebut sebagai bagian paket peluncuran GIIAS 2026. Long Range menambahkan ESC, EPB dengan auto hold, hill hold, kamera belakang, smart entry, dan layar 10,1 inci. Ground clearance 184 mm hanya dari oto.com. Tipe motor, berat kosong, dan heat pump (tidak ada) dari spesifikasi Tiongkok Hongguang Mini EV empat pintu 2026 versi 301 km (25,1 kWh, 30 kW, 85 Nm; data.carnewschina.com)."
